        <div class="software-grid" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            <span class="software-item">Panzerdrifter - Combat Racing</span>
            <span class="software-item">Mentirosos - Card Game</span>
            <span class="software-item">TTSI - Tower Defense</span>
            <span class="software-item">Bar Espacial - Final Year Project</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; text-align: center; color: #666;">
        <p><strong>Available for freelance opportunities and collaboration.</strong></p>
        <p>Contact me to discuss your project ideas!</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>